        "text": "This 7-day itinerary for your family of four (two adults, two children ages 8 and 12) to Orlando, Florida, from October 20-27, 2024, focuses on a magical balance of theme park thrills and family relaxation. You'll experience the wonder of Walt Disney World and the immersive worlds of Universal Studios, all while managing a moderate budget."
